---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="box skills">
  <div class="panel stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
    <span class="badge"><Icon icon="terminal-window" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient /></span>
    <h2>Full Stack</h2>
    <p>C# - C++ - Python - Angular - React - Kotlin. But also a bit of Golang, a bit of Rust, a lot of GDScript, some plantUml for diagrams, some svg icons design in code, etc. Tell me what you want</p>
    <p>I'll help you achieve it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="panel stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
    <span class="badge"><Icon icon="trophy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient /></span>
    <h2>High-Stakes Software</h2>
    <p>Railway simulators, defence, and now healthcare AI. Software where getting it wrong is not an option.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="panel stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
    <span class="badge"><Icon icon="strategy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient /></span>
    <h2>Dev Ops</h2>
    <p>
      CI/CD, Docker, on-site deployments. At home: two Proxmox servers and a VPS running 30+ self-hosted services, from Home Assistant to game servers. <a href="/project/homelab">More here</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .badge {
    display: flex;
  }

  /* ===== Normal style ===== */

  :global(html:not(.comic)) .box {
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  :global(html:not(.comic)) .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  :global(html:not(.comic)) .skills h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  :global(html:not(.comic)) .skills p {
    color: var(--gray-400);
  }

  @media (min-width: 50em) {
    :global(html:not(.comic)) .box {
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      padding: 2.5rem;
    }

    :global(html:not(.comic)) .skills {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 5rem;
    }

    :global(html:not(.comic)) .skills h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    }
  }

  /* ===== Comic style ===== */

  :global(html.comic) .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  :global(html.comic) .panel {
    --tint: var(--yellow);
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--pop);
  }

  :global(html.comic) .panel:nth-child(2) {
    --tint: var(--cyan);
  }
  :global(html.comic) .panel:nth-child(3) {
    --tint: var(--magenta);
  }

  /* Halftone in the panel's ink colour, bleeding from the corner. */
  :global(html.comic) .panel::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(var(--tint) 2px, transparent 2.3px) 0 0 / 10px 10px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, #000, transparent 60%);
  }

  :global(html.comic) .badge {
    display: flex;
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--on-accent);
    background: var(--tint);
    border: var(--border-thin);
    box-shadow: var(--pop-sm);
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
  }

  :global(html.comic) .badge :global(svg) {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  :global(html.comic) .skills h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
  }

  :global(html.comic) .skills p {
    position: relative;
    color: var(--gray-300);
  }

  @media (min-width: 50em) {
    :global(html.comic) .skills {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    :global(html.comic) .panel {
      padding: 2.25rem;
    }

    /* Mismatched panel angles. */
    :global(html.comic) .panel:nth-child(1) {
      transform: rotate(-1deg);
    }
    :global(html.comic) .panel:nth-child(2) {
      transform: translateY(1.5rem) rotate(0.8deg);
    }
    :global(html.comic) .panel:nth-child(3) {
      transform: rotate(-0.5deg);
    }

    :global(html.comic) .skills h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    }
  }

</style>
